Cell["Exact optimal solution for f(U) = U^T with n = 4 calls and d = 2 (Table 2: fidelity 1). The blocks B[lambda,mu] of the comb Choi matrix in the basis of the matrix units idempotents/elementary_4_1_2.m (register order O_1..O_4, P | I_1..I_4, F); guessAnsatz maps the variables x[lambda,mu,i,j,k,l] of app4.nb to their exact values. Evaluate the definition cells of app4.nb with {p,q,d} = {4,1,2} first.", "Text"],

