Cell["Check: substitute the solution into the 672 exact linear constraints of this problem, i.e. the normalisation Tr C = d^5 = 32 and the sequential-comb conditions (172) written in the variables x[lambda,mu,i,j,k,l] (app4_data/eq_4_1_2_exact.m). The expected result is {0}. Positivity holds by construction: every block B[lambda,mu] above is either v^T.D.v with a diagonal D >= 0 or a diagonal matrix with entries >= 0.", "Text"],

